 126:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c **** 
 127:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****       (#) The compilation flag USE_HAL_I2S_REGISTER_CALLBACKS when set to 1U
 128:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****           allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 129:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****           Use Functions HAL_I2S_RegisterCallback() to register an interrupt callback.
 130:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c **** 
 131:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****           Function HAL_I2S_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 132:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) TxCpltCallback        : I2S Tx Completed callback
 133:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) RxCpltCallback        : I2S Rx Completed callback
 134:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) TxRxCpltCallback      : I2S TxRx Completed callback
 135:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) TxHalfCpltCallback    : I2S Tx Half Completed callback
 136:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****             (++) RxHalfCpltCallback    : I2S Rx Half Completed callback
