 158:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        [..]
 159:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        By default, after the HAL_I2S_Init() and when the state is HAL_I2S_STATE_RESET
 160:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 161:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        examples HAL_I2S_MasterTxCpltCallback(), HAL_I2S_MasterRxCpltCallback().
 162:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 163:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        reset to the legacy weak functions in the HAL_I2S_Init()/ HAL_I2S_DeInit() only when
 164:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 165:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the HAL_I2S_Init()/ HAL_I2S_DeInit()
 166:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state
 167:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c **** 
 168:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        [..]
 169:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in HAL_I2S_STATE_READY state only.
 170:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 171:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        in HAL_I2S_STATE_READY or HAL_I2S_STATE_RESET state,
 172:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 173:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 174:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        using HAL_I2S_RegisterCallback() before calling HAL_I2S_DeInit()
 175:stm/stm32f4xx/STM32F4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f4xx_hal_i2s.c ****        or HAL_I2S_Init() function.
